<p>Welcome to <strong>Skinz &amp; Bubbles</strong> (formerly Skinz &amp; Nipples). These Terms &amp; Conditions ("Terms") describe the rules for using the Skinz &amp; Bubbles website and app, creating accounts, browsing event information, participating in the community, and—when available—purchasing tickets for our events (together, the "Services").</p>
