<p>Skinz &amp; Bubbles intends to use its existing WordPress/Eventin Pro system and its selected payment provider for live checkout. That integration <strong>is not active in this app prototype</strong>. On-screen test orders, sample tickets, and sample QR displays are not valid for admission and do not represent completed payments.</p>
